{"author":{"id":"dec876858d28babbadcead4137861bf586626b8518cbce9c5f4fc52ac3b424b8"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790983783,"nonce":"BedsVoyDcSzLio1CPAC85kE83jg=","title":"ColorTokens::default() still returns the retired Catppuccin palette","message":"BlincTheme is HybridTheme since 608933b0 (Catppuccin retired), but tokens/color.rs ColorTokens::default() still returns the Catppuccin Latte light palette. Anything that falls back to ColorTokens::default() gets the old look. ashui made its equivalent return HybridTheme::light().colors. Related, minor: ThemeState::tick ends a scheme transition once the spring is within 1 of its 0..100 target, so the final colours are the lerp at about 0.99, not the target; ashui assigns to_colors on the finishing frame.","files":null}]}